    ["1.<Highlight>大地图</>上实时显示旗帜所在位置。\n2.<Highlight>右上角小地图</>也会持续显示旗帜方向，可根据指引方向寻找旗帜。\n3.<Highlight>集结·俱乐部宣战</>:俱乐部宣战期间，<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可在霍纳奇斯山脉使用该道具，使用该道具将向<Highlight>地图内的本俱乐部成员</>发起集结。使用后，将以俱乐部为单位，使该道具全部进入 <Highlight>360</> 秒冷却。该道具可从 <Highlight>百货-同行商店-俱乐部</> 获取。"] = "1.<Highlight>The location of the Flag is displayed in real-time on the </>World Map\n. 2.<Highlight>The mini-map in the top right corner</> will also continuously show the direction of the Flag; you can follow the guidance to find it.\n 3.<Highlight>Assemble · Club Declaration of War</>: During a Club Declaration of War, the <Highlight>President, Vice President, and Councilors</> can use this item within the Hornacis Mountain Range. Using this item will initiate an assembly for <Highlight>members of this club within the map</>. Once used, the item will enter a <Highlight>360</>-second cooldown for the entire club. This item can be obtained from <Highlight>Department Store - Peer Shop - Club</>.",
    ["1.怪物出生时隐藏头顶信息。"] = "1. Hide overhead information when monster spawns.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【猎城战】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>猎城战</>是势力战中的<Assistant_Red>1000人</>大战场。战场资格会在每轮四方联赛第一场结束后<Assistant_Red>21:20</>分配，系统会根据俱乐部综合实力，将各俱乐部分配至猎城战或高原战。获得资格的俱乐部成员，可在<Assistant_System>以战养战-势力-猎城战</>界面查看赛程安排。同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Assistant_Red>16人</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>第一阶段：</>从己方<Assistant_Property1>要塞</>出发，沿着<Assistant_Property1>前哨</>、<Assistant_Property1>营地</>推进；占领营地后即可攻击相连接的<Assistant_Property1>战争石碑</>。需要占领和己方营地相连的两处石碑，方可攻击<Assistant_Property1>王城城门</>；己方石碑被敌方攻占后，会失去攻击城门的资格。\n<Assistant_Title2>第二阶段：</>王城城门被攻破后，可前往中央平台占领王城。平台上人数最多的势力将积累<Assistant_Property1>占领值</>；在中央平台击杀敌方势力的非凡者，也可为己方势力增加占领值。占领值达到<Assistant_Red>100%</>时，即占领王城。占领中央王城可直接结束战场，并获得最后赢家奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>战场特色：</>可在己方要塞乘坐<Assistant_Property1>蒸汽火车</>快速到达前方营地，攻击城门时可使用<Assistant_Property1>攻城车</>。<Assistant_Property1>战争巨龙</>会盘踞在中央王城，并在战斗中现身。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往猎城战]|1250322}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hunting City Battle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Hunting City Battle</> is a <Assistant_Red>1000-player</> large-scale battlefield in the Faction War. Battlefield eligibility is assigned at <Assistant_Red>21:20</> after the first match of each Four-Way League round. The system will assign clubs to either the Hunting City Battle or the Highland Battle based on their overall strength. Eligible club members can view the schedule in the <Assistant_System>War-Driven Growth - Faction - Hunting City Battle</> interface. A single club can field a maximum of <Assistant_Red>16 people</> from the same Pathway.\n<Assistant_Title2>Phase 1: </>Depart from your <Assistant_Property1>Stronghold</> and advance along <Assistant_Property1>Outposts</> and <Assistant_Property1>Camps</>. After occupying a camp, you can attack the connected <Assistant_Property1>War Stele</>. You must occupy two steles connected to your camp to attack the <Assistant_Property1>Royal City Gate</>; if your stele is captured by the enemy, you lose the eligibility to attack the gate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Phase 2: </>After the Royal City Gate is breached, you can proceed to the central platform to occupy the Royal City. The faction with the most people on the platform will accumulate <Assistant_Property1>Occupation Value</>; killing enemy Beyonders on the central platform also increases your faction's Occupation Value. When the Occupation Value reaches <Assistant_Red>100%</>, the Royal City is occupied. Occupying the central Royal City ends the battlefield immediately and grants the final winner's rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Battlefield Features: </>You can take a <Assistant_Property1>Steam Train</> from your stronghold to quickly reach forward camps, and use <Assistant_Property1>Siege Engines</> when attacking the gate. <Assistant_Property1>War Dragons</> will perch on the central Royal City and appear during the battle.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>{JumpToUI:[Go to Hunting City Battle]|1250322}",
    ["<M_Default>尊贵的非凡者阁下：</>\n　　你是那位伟大存在特别眷顾之人，世界也因你的活跃而焕新。如今，我将替祂感谢你在这里付出的一切，为你定制了一份特别礼物。\n　　请收下这份与你相称的荣光，领取属于你的专属充值奖励。"] = "<M_Default> Honorable Beyonder: </>\n You are one specially favored by that Great Old One, and the world has been renewed by your activity. Now, I shall thank you on Their behalf for everything you have contributed here and have customized a special gift for you. \n Please accept this glory befitting you and claim your exclusive top-up rewards.",
